  "item_short_desc": "<p>Through a blend of military heritage and contemporary styling, our Quilted MA-1 Flight Jacket is equipped with warm poly fiberfill for exceptional insulation, keeping you warm in cold conditions. The bomber jacket features a nylon water-repellent outer shell that provides protection from light rain and snow. This statement piece seamlessly blends tradition and modernness, ensuring you look and feel your best wherever you go.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133335",
  "description": "<p>Through a blend of military heritage and contemporary styling, our Quilted MA-1 Flight Jacket is equipped with warm poly fiberfill for exceptional insulation, keeping you warm in cold conditions. The bomber jacket features a nylon water-repellent outer shell that provides protection from light rain and snow. This statement piece seamlessly blends tradition and modernness, ensuring you look and feel your best wherever you go. Unbeatable Comfort and Warmth: These quilted aviator jackets feature a soft ribbed knit collar, cuffs, and waistband for additional heat retention and insulation while blocking out the wind. The MA-1 bomber jacket has an extra full cut for a comfortable fit with room underneath for extra layers, ideal for winter and cold weather. Utility Pockets: Our ruggedly durable puffer flight jackets come equipped with 5 pockets: 2 front slash pockets and 2 inner pockets for everyday essentials, and what&rsquo;s a bomber jacket without a zippered utility sleeve pocket!? Along with exterior pen holders, this useful pocket is great for storing small items. Legendary MA-1 Silhouette: In keeping with tradition, this modernized twist in style still retains iconic MA-1 features. Inside you&rsquo;ll find a fully reversible orange polyester lining that&rsquo;s similar to the original fighter pilot design. The zippered front closure with double &lsquo;MA-1&rsquo; pull tabs, storm flap, brass zippers, and leather pull tab pays homage to the jacket&rsquo;s heritage, functionality, and style. Take Flight: Whether you are military personnel, aviation enthusiast, or outdoor adventurer, the pilot bomber jacket is perfect as a windbreaker for spring and fall seasons while presenting a classic style that is great for casual outings and everyday use.</p>",
